{
  "body": "Back\nTo access your notes on other devices you need to set up sync.\n\nBecause Obsidian stores your notes on your devices, you'll need to set up sync if you want to access your notes on another phone or computer.\n\nYou can set up sync now, or just start writing and set it up later.\n\n1.15.0\nContinue without sync\nSet up sync",
  "html": "\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/codemirror.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/overlay.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/markdown.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/cm-addons.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/vim.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/codemirror/meta.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/moment.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/i18next.min.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/scrypt.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"lib/turndown.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"enhance.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"i18n.js\"></script>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" defer=\"\" src=\"app.js\"></script>\n\n\n<div class=\"mobile-onboarding\"><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-navbar\"><div class=\"back-button u-pop tappable\" style=\"\">Back</div></div><div class=\"mobile-onboarding-screen\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" fill=\"none\" class=\"logo\"><path d=\"M355.662 428.646C353.2 446.929 335.311 461.212 317.533 456.281C292.203 449.301 262.874 438.415 236.484 436.387C233.004 436.119 196.037 433.316 196.037 433.316C189.498 432.85 183.36 429.993 178.793 425.29L109.1 353.516C101.484 345.673 99.4221 333.977 103.898 324.002C103.898 324.002 146.992 229.286 148.593 224.361C150.193 219.435 156.067 176.476 159.548 153.397C160.47 147.281 163.49 141.675 168.088 137.538L250.533 63.3697C262.003 53.0514 279.807 54.5804 289.349 66.7034L358.607 154.688C362.526 159.668 364.534 165.856 364.563 172.192C364.642 188.861 366.018 223.085 375.233 245.128C384.199 266.569 400.652 289.725 409.251 301.119C412.551 305.492 413.056 311.406 410.269 316.122C404.2 326.398 392.209 346.128 375.233 371.443C363.53 388.897 358.107 410.473 355.662 428.646Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path><path d=\"M186.206 430.921C251.142 299.269 182.648 242.339 144.398 218.766\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"12\"></path><path d=\"M374.343 386.444C332.98 289.929 272.491 288.595 210.224 303.717\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"12\"></path><path d=\"M274.27 297.045C212.447 142.266 322.305 143.6 283.61 52.8673\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"12\"></path></svg><h1>To access your notes on other devices you need to set up sync.</h1><form id=\"form\"><p>Because Obsidian stores your notes on your devices, you'll need to set up sync if you want to access your notes on another phone or computer.</p><p>You can set up sync now, or just start writing and set it up later.</p></form><footer><div class=\"mod-version\">1.15.0</div></footer><div class=\"button-container\"><button class=\"mod-cta\">Continue without sync</button><button>Set up sync</button></div></div></div>",
